    <string name="k_guide_new_app_title">Dear users</string>
    <string name="k_guide_new_app_content">Hello! We are truly sorry for the inconvenience caused to you. Previously, due to the fact that our application did not fully comply with Apple\'s relevant regulations, it was complained about and taken off the shelves. After our all-out efforts in rectification over this period, we have resolved all the issues and successfully launched a brand-new application.\n To ensure that you can continue to enjoy safe, compliant, and high-quality services, this current application will soon be uninstalled, and you need to download our newly launched application to keep using our services. The new application has not only fixed the previous problems but also optimized and enhanced the functions and user experience. We hope it will bring you a better experience.\n Thank you for your continuous support and understanding. Please also give us another chance to serve you. You can click on the link below to go to the App Store and download the new application. If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to contact us at any time.</string>
